From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:03:02 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 056/230] Fix Telegram launch 404, group national sides as
 international, seed rest-of-world clubs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Telegram appends init data to the launch URL, and any form of it breaks boot:
the canonical hash made HashRouter read `tgWebAppData=...` as a route (404
screen), while the path form tripped the SPA fallback's file-extension 404.
Strip the params before React Router is created and keep the init data for
auth, so a Telegram user is neither 404'd nor downgraded to a guest.

National sides now group as `international` from a `league=''` default even
with no fixture synced yet, while clubs from lower leagues and cup-only sides
fall into `other`. The seed gains ~56 famous non-big-five clubs (Ajax, Porto,
Celtic, Galatasaray, …) under their real ESPN slugs to fill that Other tab,
each verified against logos.json and team-colors.json.

